Output scan.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 820
Set Theme { "background": "#151312", "foreground": "#e9e3dc", "cursor": "#d9784f" }
Hide
Type "cd ~/Desktop/globalcare-ai && clear" Enter
Show
Type "jevx --dry-run --yes" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 420s
